<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Manufactured Home started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Manufactured Home started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz said analyst Jamie Handwerker initiated coverage of Manufactured Home Communities Inc, adding the stock to the firm's recommended list.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 3/16 to 24-1/16.</p>
</text>
